<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Shelby Williams started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Shelby Williams started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lazard Freres &amp; Co analyst Todd Slater said he initiated coverage of Shelby Williams Industries Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $19 a share.</p>
<p>-- said expects Shelby Williams to earn $1.10 a share in 1997 and $1.25 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- Shelby Williams lost 1/4 to 12-3/8 in afternoon trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
